Package: jnanalytics
Type: Package
Title: Open Data About the Journal Market in Transformative Agreements
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Najko", "Jahn", , "najko.jahn@sub.uni-goettingen.de",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5105-1463"))
Description: Builds and documents a tidy data model about scholarly
    journals covered by transformative agreements, distinguishing hybrid
    from fully open access journals. Reference tables describe journals,
    agreements and dashboard portfolios once; article-level and
    journal-level count tables are built in Google BigQuery from Crossref
    and OpenAlex, using journal lists from the cOAlition S Journal Checker
    Tool and the ESAC registry. Successor of the 'hoaddata' package.
